# Assertion concepts (PR #1188 G13): adding one assertion of a stated call
# and value to a named test file. Split from meanings-coding-tasks.lino so
# every reviewable Links Notation source stays below the repository line bound.
meanings
  coding_assertion
    defined-by code
    role coding_assertion_kind
    precondition "a coding request asks to add this concept to a named test file"
    effect "one assertion is written in the test file's own assertion form and the file is run (PR #1188 G13)"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "assertion"
    lexeme en "assertion"
    lexeme ru утверждение проверку
    lexeme hi अभिकथन
    lexeme zh 断言
    lexeme es aserción
  coding_assertion_equality
    defined-by relation
    role coding_assertion_equality_cue
    precondition "an assertion request states a call, then this cue, then the call's expected value"
    effect "the text before the cue is the asserted call and the text after it the expected value"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "equals"
    lexeme en "is equal to" equals returns
    lexeme ru равно возвращает
    lexeme hi "के बराबर है" "लौटाता है"
    lexeme zh 等于 返回
    lexeme es "es igual a" devuelve
